# Cloudflare Pages reads this file automatically and applies these headers
# to every response. Harmless (ignored) on GitHub Pages, so safe to ship
# ahead of the actual migration.
#
# A strict Content-Security-Policy is deliberately NOT included yet — this
# site pulls from several third-party origins (Google Fonts, cdnjs, the
# Supabase project URL, picsum.photos placeholder images, and eventually
# Stripe.js once billing is enabled), and getting a CSP allowlist wrong
# silently breaks the site rather than failing loudly. Worth doing as a
# follow-up once the Supabase project URL and Stripe are both finalised.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
